		{
			"date": "2023-07-12T22:19:50-07:00",
			"message": "sprites: fix up barrel and octo deaths.\nThe base of the barrel remained consistent in its last two frames, causing it to seem very static and unaffected before suddenly disappearing. This adds a bit more of a gradual disintegration.\r\nThe octaminator has a few fixes:\r\n- the tentacle suddenly appearing behind it in the final frame didn't look right. It's been reduced and a hint of it is given in the preceding frame.\r\n- the antepenultimate frame show the right shoulder falling much further to the side than the frame after it shows. That arm is moved closer to the centre.\r\n- got rid of some of the pillow shading on the right front tentacle-leg in the last two frames.",
			"source": "freedoom",
			"url": "https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/commit/383fb42c458cee6d6bd86db7bdf348c241ad540a",
			"sha": "383fb42c458cee6d6bd86db7bdf348c241ad540a",
			"contributions": [
				{
